  "description": "Ten years after his master vanished while hunting a cult that unleashes yokai, young Taoist Dangchan saves Jin Seorang, a woman pursued by the ruthless Maewoldang sect. Known for enslaving people by turning them into yokai, Maewoldang is Jin Seorang's sworn enemy, and she seeks Dangchan's aid in destroying them. As they fight against dark sorcery, Dangchan discovers a startling truth—Maewoldang's leader holds clues to his master's disappearance. With the world still in turmoil, Dangchan wields his mystical arts, determined to restore order and fulfill his destiny.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
